{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2025-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1761264000, "end_date": 1761955199, "month_true_total": 27, "quota": 5, "returned": 4, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:57:23 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "207668656", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996524977", "personaname": "Grendug", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Grendug/", "num_games_owned": 494, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 10653, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2877, "last_played": 1787352722, "avatar": "4664ec5d87505ca752bb517fcfcfab029eeb7329"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent horde shooter. Great with friends. I highly recommend it.\r\n+ Up to four player multi-player\r\n+ Tons of weapons and upgrades\r\n+ 4 classes to pick from\r\n+ 100+ missions\r\n+ NPC's have funny commentary and are fully voiced\r\n\r\n- Only 4 players\r\n- Controls take a bit to get used to. Buttons can be reassigned\r\n- Tad grindy as you do have to replay missions to fully upgrade your weapons and hp.", "timestamp_created": 1761509608, "timestamp_updated": 1761509608, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207664354", "author": {"steamid": "76561199813630274", "personaname": "梁山麻醉槍", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199813630274/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3723, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2984, "last_played": 1770468879, "avatar": "2d6c28b0cddc50218a7bb40c59a4e8430b4415f4"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10", "timestamp_created": 1761506295, "timestamp_updated": 1761506295, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207630209", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040581863", "personaname": "[LWDN PMC] Capt. Akehiko Urabaya", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Akehiko/", "num_games_owned": 494, "num_reviews": 276, "playtime_forever": 1395, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1395, "last_played": 1761478830, "avatar": "ef27830b6fdf0d0e939792346e52240d083b1a83"}, "language": "english", "review": "Japanese grind slop game like the previous ones\n\nUnplayable without the auto pick up mod\n\nOn solo EDF 5 is the most boring open field experience you've seen (any class besides the wing diver will spend 60% of the time just walking) , or you're in a mission that has nothing but flying enemies and you can't even see anything as they do 360 degree drive by's\n\nThe AI at times might kill something but they get in your way more than anything, in later levels they are basically useless\n\nI got to mission 97 but it's such a chore that I'll just drop it, might give EDF 4.1 a try again", "timestamp_created": 1761479352, "timestamp_updated": 1761479352, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.466310203075408936", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 5}]}, {"recommendationid": "207577052", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988863492", "personaname": "Xol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197988863492/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 25422, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25422, "last_played": 1647802119, "avatar": "31d4ad7a159da1e5a160a824a8c2f1e305d6fc33"}, "language": "english", "review": "OH WE ARE THE VALIANT INFANTRY!\n\nThe EDF series doesn't take itself seriously at all, with tons of (intentionally) painful B movie-caliber dialogue and story beats.  Don't let that or the graphics fool you, though, the gameplay is stellar. Also, while I enjoyed EDF6, I think I still prefer EDF5 over it, especially as an Air Raider main.", "timestamp_created": 1761421065, "timestamp_updated": 1761421065, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}